      "effectSize": "Mean intrinsic capacity declined from 75.8 at age 70 to 51.8 at age 100; higher intrinsic capacity was consistently associated with improved survival across follow-up (except the 78–85 band)",
      "diseaseBurden": "The global population aged 65+ is projected to reach ~2 billion by 2050; healthy-aging metrics are increasingly central to geriatric care",
